            </a>
            <a href="/ai-asistenti">
              <b>&bdquo;Nest&iacute;h&aacute;m odpov&iacute;dat z&aacute;kazn&iacute;k&uring;m.&ldquo;</b>
              <small>Asistent objedn&aacute;v&aacute;, p&rcaron;ipom&iacute;n&aacute; a odpov&iacute;d&aacute; za v&aacute;s. <em>nasazen&iacute; do 5&ndash;7 prac. dn&iacute;</em></small>
            </a>
            <a class="drop__all" href="/cenik">Nev&iacute;te? Za&ccaron;n&ecaron;te cen&iacute;kem &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li><a href="/tvorba-webu" aria-current={cur("/tvorba-webu")}>Weby</a></li>
        <li><a href="/vyvoj-softwaru" aria-current={cur("/vyvoj-softwaru")}>Software</a></li>
        <li><a href="/ai-asistenti" aria-current={cur("/ai-asistenti")}>AI asistenti</a></li>
        <li><a href="/o-nas" aria-current={cur("/o-nas")}>O n&aacute;s</a></li>
        <li><a href="/kontakt" aria-current={cur("/kontakt")}>Kontakt</a></li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-live btn-magnet" href={cta}>Nez&aacute;vazn&aacute; nab&iacute;dka</a>
      <button class="burger" id="burger" type="button" aria-label="Otev&rcaron;&iacute;t menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sheet">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>
